    <string name="settings_read_privacy">Read Full Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_dialog_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_full">Effective Date: 2026\n\n1. Zero Data Collection\nCalcForge is designed with privacy first. We do not collect, transmit, or store any personal information, telemetry, analytics, crash logs, advertising identifiers, or usage statistics.\n\n2. 100% Offline Operation\nAll scientific calculations, physics and chemistry unit conversions, currency reference conversions, date calculations, and body composition metrics (BMI, Body Fat, Visceral Fat, Body Age) run entirely on your device without any internet connection.\n\n3. Local-Only Storage\nYour calculation history and app preferences (theme, angle unit, memory register) are saved exclusively in private local storage on your device. You can delete individual items or clear all history at any time from the History tab.\n\n4. No Accounts or Third-Party Tracking\nCalcForge requires no login, no account creation, and contains no third-party tracking SDKs or ad networks.\n\n5. Your Control\nUninstalling the application removes all locally stored history and preferences from your device.</string>
